  Where Geopolitics Happens</h4><p data-path-to-node="14">  How do you go 
 from starting out in global affairs to shaping U.S. cyber strategy\, dire
 cting counterterrorism operations\, and advising the Pentagon\, White Hou
 se\, and Senate?</p><p data-path-to-node="15">  Join the Global Competenc
