SUMMARY:Public Tour: Artwork from Around the World
DESCRIPTION:This is a small group experience led by Community Guides who 
 enjoy sharing a love of art. The experience may be a little different eac
 h time to include a variety of artworks.  &#160\;  Know Before You GoSpac
 e is available for the first 12 people to check in with Guest Services on
  the day. Drop by the information desk on the first floor of the museum w
 hen you arrive.A small handbag may be carried at your side. Backpacks and
  large bags will need to be stored before touring. Learn more aboutmuseum
  guidelines.If you park in the IMU parking lot\, Guest Services can valid
 ate your parking voucher for a discount.Read aboutwhere to find us and wh
 ere to park\,
