SUMMARY:⏰DUE TONIGHT: HLS D.C. Global Policy Program
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Washington D.C. Global Policy Program. (https:
 //hls.indiana.edu/careers/dc-global-policy-program/index.html)  Washingto
 n DC Summer Practicum  This eight-week intensive summer program for selec
 t students puts you in the middle of it all. Spend five days per week at 
 a full-time internship and two nights per week in the classroom at our IU
  headquarters at our new IU Capital Campus. This experience cultivates pr
 actical professional skills while helping you build the network critical 
 to a successful career in Washington\, D.C.✔ Live and learn in the hear
 t of U.S. government✔ Build real-world experience and a DC network✔ E
 xplore agencies\, embassies\, and think tanks✔ Have a semester you'll n
 ever forget  Build a Network That Lasts    Take advantage of IU's presenc
 e in Washington  Connect with IU alumni working across industries    Atte
 nd networking events and professional panels    Develop relationships tha
 t can support internships\, job opportunities\, and mentorship    Your ca
 reer doesn't start after graduation—it starts here.Open to all undergra
 d\, master's &amp\; PhD students.Apply Here:https://iu.co1.qualtrics.com/
 jfe/form/SV_bxucZoEtLdi24a (https://iu.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_bxuc
 ZoEtLdi24aW)
